          "source": "reviewer",
          "detail": "D2 [CL3 calculationIds; counterarguments item 3 response] K12 is the USD sensitivity calculation ((8M-6M) x 0.01 = USD 20,000). Draft 2 cites it as the 'basis' for the EUR 2M residual and the EUR 2M top-up in the staged-execution text, and adds it to CL3's calculationIds. K12 does not compute either EUR figure. The EUR 2M figures come from K1 minus K2, or a new calculation such as 8M - 6M."
        }
      ]
    }
